# 本地业务 API（REST Client / httpYac）
# 先启动：pnpm --filter agentic-rag-business-service dev
# 默认端口见 apps/agentic-rag-business-service/.env.dev（9020；9000/9001 为 Compose RustFS）

@host = http://127.0.0.1
@port = 9020
@baseUrl = {{host}}:{{port}}

### Root greeting
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Typed greeting (oRPC contract route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/greeting

### Health whoami
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/whoami

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### List documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents?page=1&pageSize=20

### Create document
# @name createDocument
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "http client smoke test",
  "content": "## smoke\n\nfrom __tests__/business-api.http"
}

### Get document (uses id from create)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}

### Update document
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "http client smoke test (updated)"
}

### Soft delete document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}

### Get after delete (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{createDocument.response.body.id}}

### Upload and parse Markdown (no MinerU token required)
# @name uploadMarkdown
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

http client upload smoke test
------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="smoke.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

## upload smoke

from __tests__/business-api.http
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Get uploaded document
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadMarkdown.response.body.id}}

### Upload test-files xlsx
# @name uploadXlsx
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="员工考勤表.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../../../test-files/员工考勤表.xlsx
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Get uploaded xlsx
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadXlsx.response.body.id}}

### Upload test-files docx
# @name uploadDocx
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="梁多强_Agent开发_17601230573.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ../../../test-files/梁多强_Agent开发_17601230573.docx
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Get uploaded docx
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadDocx.response.body.id}}

### Upload test-files pdf
# @name uploadPdf
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="李先生_28岁_76761.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../../test-files/李先生_28岁_76761.pdf
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Get uploaded pdf
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadPdf.response.body.id}}

### Upload test-files pptx
# @name uploadPptx
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="申论总结课.pptx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation

< ../../../test-files/申论总结课.pptx
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Get uploaded pptx
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{uploadPptx.response.body.id}}

### Upload unsupported type (expect 415 DOCUMENT_FILE_TYPE_UNSUPPORTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/upload/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AgentHubBoundary

------AgentHubBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="tool.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

MZ
------AgentHubBoundary--

### Validation error (expect 400 — missing content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "bad request"
}
